NOTICE FOR REDISTRIBUTED COMPONENTS

This product redistributes the above components in a "fat JAR" (shadow JAR)
with package relocation (shading) to avoid dependency conflicts:

- com.fasterxml.jackson.* relocated to com.workday.ldq.jdbc.shaded.jackson.*
- com.nimbusds.* relocated to com.workday.ldq.jdbc.shaded.nimbusds.*
- org.bouncycastle.* relocated to com.workday.ldq.jdbc.shaded.bouncycastle.*

The Trino JDBC Driver is included without relocation to maintain compatibility
with the standard Trino JDBC interface.

